doctype html
html(lang="en")
head
meta(charset="UTF-8")
meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
title SCM Conference 2026 - Abstract Review Decision

body(
style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#FDFCFB; font-family:'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;"
)
.wrapper(style="padding:30px 10px;")
.container(
style="max-width:600px; margin:auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border:1px solid #f1f5f9;"
)

    include header

    .content(style="padding:40px;")
      h2(
        style=`margin:0 0 25px; color:${brandBlue}; font-size:24px;`
      )
        | Abstract Review Decision

      p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
        | Dear #{name},

      p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
        | Thank you for submitting your abstract to the
        strong  International Conference on Building Resilient Supply Chains 2026.

      p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
        | After careful evaluation through the conference peer-review process, we regret to inform you that your abstract was not selected for acceptance at this time.

      table(
        width="100%"
        border="0"
        cellspacing="0"
        cellpadding="0"
        style=`margin:30px 0; background:#fef2f2; border-left:4px solid #dc2626; border-radius:8px;`
      )
        tr
          td(style="padding:22px 24px;")
            p(style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:14px;")
              strong Abstract Title:
            p(style="margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#334155;")
              | #{title}

      .notice(
        style="margin:25px 0; padding:18px; background:#fff7ed; border:1px solid #fed7aa; border-radius:10px;"
      )
        p(
          style="margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#c2410c;"
        )
          | The conference received many high-quality submissions, and the review process was highly competitive.

      p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
        | This decision does not necessarily reflect the overall quality or significance of your research. We sincerely appreciate the effort invested in preparing and submitting your work.

      p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
        | We encourage you to continue your research activities and consider submitting future work to upcoming editions of the conference.

      p(style="margin-top:25px; font-size:15px;")
        | If you have any questions, please contact us at
        a(
          href="mailto:helpdesk-scm@ewubd.edu"
          style=`color:${brandBlue}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;`
        )
          | helpdesk-scm@ewubd.edu

      p(style="margin:30px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
        | Thank you for your interest in SCM Conference 2026.

    include footer

